---
// IndustriesCrossSector.astro
// "The Same Engineering. Every Sector." two-column section.
// Background: DARK navy gradient
// Cards: white on dark section
---

<style>
  /* ── DARK navy gradient ── */
  .cross-sector {
    padding-block: clamp(48px, 8vh, 96px);
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 70% at 65% 40%, rgba(8,56,146,0.9) 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 5%  90%, rgba(192,24,30,.07) 0%, transparent 50%),
      linear-gradient(155deg, var(--navy-deep) 0%, var(--ink) 55%, var(--black) 100%);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cross-inner {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px);
  }

  /* Stack on mobile, side-by-side at 1024px */
  .cross-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .cross-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }

  /* Section tag — crimson-l on dark */
  .section-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-tag .line { width: 28px; height: 2px; background: var(--crimson); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .section-tag span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--crimson-l);
  }

  /* Headline — white + red accent (dark section) */
  .section-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 800; 
    font-size:clamp(32px,4.5vw,56px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: .97;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-headline .accent { color: var(--crimson-l); }

  /* Left copy — fog on dark */
  .cross-copy p {
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.5vw, 16px);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--fog);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .cross-copy p strong { color: var(--white); font-weight: 500; }

  /* Right points — white cards on dark section */
  .cross-points {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .cross-point {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: clamp(16px, 2vw, 22px);
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    border-top: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: border-top-color .25s, box-shadow .25s, transform .25s;
  }
  .cross-point:hover {
    border-top-color: #c0181e;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.32);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* Icon — crimson on white card */
  .cp-icon {
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    background: rgba(192,24,30,.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(192,24,30,.2);
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: #c0181e;
  }
  .cp-icon svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }

  /* Card text — dark on white card */
  .cp-title {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.4vw, 16px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .05em;
    color: 
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .cp-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #3a4560;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Reveal */
  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity .65s ease, transform .65s ease; }
  .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; } }
</style>

<section class="cross-sector" aria-labelledby="cross-heading">
  <div class="cross-inner">
    <div class="cross-grid">

      <!-- Left: copy -->
      <div class="cross-copy reveal">
        <div class="section-tag"><div class="line"></div><span>Why Jayveecons</span></div>
        <h2 class="section-headline" id="cross-heading">
          Transforming Industrial Experience <br><span class="accent">Into Engineered Solutions.</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          What makes Jayveecons different isn't that we serve many industries — it's that
          <strong>the same engineering rigour</strong> we developed building VSK kilns in 1987
          underpins everything we fabricate today. Whether the material is cement raw meal or
          grain, clinker or pharmaceutical powder, the first-principles engineering is identical.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our cross-sector experience means we don't re-learn material behaviour from scratch
          on every project. We draw on decades of data from abrasive mineral handling and apply
          it to wear-lining a food-grade screw. We apply our pressure vessel experience from
          pneumatic conveying to oil &amp; gas containment requirements.
          <strong>Cross-sector knowledge is not a marketing claim — it's our fabrication advantage.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: feature points — white cards -->
      <div class="cross-points reveal">

        <div class="cross-point">
          <div class="cp-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="cp-title">In-House Fabrication</div>
            <p class="cp-desc">Every component machined, rolled, welded, and balanced in our own facility — no sub-contractors for critical parts.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cross-point">
          <div class="cp-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
              <path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 010 14.14M4.93 4.93a10 10 0 000 14.14"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="cp-title">Material-First Design</div>
            <p class="cp-desc">We begin every enquiry with material properties — bulk density, abrasiveness, moisture, temperature — before selecting equipment type.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cross-point">
          <div class="cp-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/>
              <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="cp-title">Complete Documentation</div>
            <p class="cp-desc">GA drawings, material certificates, weld maps, hydrostatic test records — supplied as standard, not as an extra.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cross-point">
          <div class="cp-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="cp-title">Engineering Support</div>
            <p class="cp-desc">Our engineers respond to technical enquiries within 24 hours and can visit site for assessment anywhere in India.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>